// Advanced Part features: sweep, ISO hole, slot, standard sections.
// The catalogs stay in @solidus-cad/sdk (single source): the client sends the resolved dimensions in `prepared`
// (`iso`: ISO_HOLES[size]; `section`: profile outline, or `error`).
//
// Naming (core/NAMING.md): names come from the sketch and the profile, never from the rank in the result:
//   - sweep, profile: face generated by the curve C of the path and the element P of the section, "side(C|P)"
//     (P: curve of the section sketch, "outer" / "inner" for a tube, "e<k>" for a profile section);
//     end faces "start" and "end";
//   - hole at point P: face generated by segment k of the hole half-profile, "hole(P.k)" (k = 0: top);
//   - slot on line L: ends "slot(L.a<k>)", "slot(L.b<k>)", straight part "slot(L.s<k>)".
